{"logId": "075bf837-940a-4888-90da-2e3557364fc9", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 1190, "height": 1684, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "header_image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [839, 135, 1083, 253], "block_id": 0, "block_order": null, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[839.0, 135.0], [1083.0, 135.0], [1083.0, 253.0], [839.0, 253.0]]}, {"block_label": "doc_title", "block_content": "胖东来如何打造快乐团队", "block_bbox": [199, 227, 780, 283], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[199.0, 227.0], [780.0, 227.0], [780.0, 283.0], [199.0, 283.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "信息来源：中国营销咨询网/周亮", "block_bbox": [544, 293, 780, 315], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[544.0, 293.0], [780.0, 293.0], [780.0, 315.0], [544.0, 315.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "他是8000多名员工的“大家长”，走进企业就像走进一个快乐的大家庭。他提倡“财聚人散，财散人聚”，他所领导的企业普通员工拿着全省零售业最高的工资。他用自己半生的坎坷遭遇，总结出的200字的企业文化里，“快乐”字样出现四次。他没有太多文化，却把“以人为本”这一最朴素的管理哲学演绎得淋漓尽致。他说自己是一个“行商”，一年待在办公室里的时间总共不到5天，所有权力下放，用人不疑，充分发挥员工个人才智。", "block_bbox": [198, 375, 975, 470], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[198.0, 375.0], [975.0, 375.0], [975.0, 470.0], [198.0, 470.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [199, 479, 601, 647], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[199.0, 479.0], [601.0, 479.0], [601.0, 647.0], [199.0, 647.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [614, 482, 966, 715], "block_id": 5, "block_order": null, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[614.0, 482.0], [966.0, 482.0], [966.0, 715.0], [614.0, 715.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "8000人的大家庭其乐融融", "block_bbox": [239, 689, 478, 715], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[239.0, 689.0], [478.0, 689.0], [478.0, 715.0], [239.0, 715.0]]}, {"block_label": "vision_footnote", "block_content": "生鲜分割师比赛现场", "block_bbox": [808, 720, 968, 740], "block_id": 7, "block_order": null, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[808.0, 719.9999389648438], [967.0, 719.9999389648438], [967.0, 738.9999389648438], [808.0, 738.9999389648438]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "走在许昌的大街小巷，无论是大型综合", "block_bbox": [238, 724, 605, 750], "block_id": 8, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[238.0, 724.0], [605.0, 724.0], [605.0, 750.0], [238.0, 750.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "商场、超市、服装市场，还是家电卖场、手机卖场及便利店，看到最多的是“胖东来”字样。而走进任何一家“胖东来”店，都挤满了正在购物的消费者。据了解，11年前“胖东来”还是一个只有4名下岗职工的30多平方米的小烟酒店。十几年来坚持“用真品换真心，不满意就退货”的承诺，赢得了广大消费者的信任，如今已发展成为拥有8000多名职工、", "block_bbox": [197, 759, 976, 891], "block_id": 9, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[197.0, 759.0], [976.0, 759.0], [976.0, 891.0], [197.0, 891.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "22个连锁店、年销售额5亿多元的大型综合零售企业。", "block_bbox": [382, 899, 831, 924], "block_id": 10, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 10, "block_polygon_points": [[382.0, 899.0], [831.0, 899.0], [831.0, 924.0], [382.0, 924.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [172, 905, 525, 1224], "block_id": 11, "block_order": null, "group_id": 11, "block_polygon_points": [[172.0, 905.0], [525.0, 905.0], [525.0, 1224.0], [172.0, 1224.0]]}, {"block_label": "vision_footnote", "block_content": "员工子弟联谊会", "block_bbox": [200, 1231, 326, 1252], "block_id": 12, "block_order": null, "group_id": 12, "block_polygon_points": [[200.0, 1231.0], [325.0, 1231.0], [325.0, 1251.0], [200.0, 1251.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "做零售业是很辛苦的，而在许昌胖东来，8000多人的大家庭却其乐融融，很多人脸上都挂着微笑，大家以兄弟姐妹相称。你能深切地体会到这里的员工没有烦闷情绪，只有盎然的笑脸和开怀的笑声。可以感受得到，他们是在发自内心地热爱着工作。记者采访时，外面正在下雨，一位保洁员不停地拖着地板。当问她工作累不累时，这位40多岁的大姐笑着说：“累是累，心里高兴！拿着比其他单位的保洁员高三四倍的工资，东来一口一个大姐地叫", "block_bbox": [514, 934, 978, 1240], "block_id": 13, "block_order": 9, "group_id": 13, "block_polygon_points": [[514.0, 934.0], [978.0, 934.0], [978.0, 1240.0], [514.0, 1240.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [1002, 609, 1137, 724], "block_id": 14, "block_order": null, "group_id": 14, "block_polygon_points": [[1002.0, 609.0], [1137.0, 609.0], [1137.0, 724.0], [1002.0, 724.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 13, "label": "header_image", "score": 0.7364627122879028, "coordinate": [839, 135, 1083, 253], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[839.0, 135.0], [1083.0, 135.0], [1083.0, 253.0], [839.0, 253.0]]}, {"cls_id": 6, "label": "doc_title", "score": 0.91634601354599, "coordinate": [199, 227, 780, 283], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[199.0, 227.0], [780.0, 227.0], [780.0, 283.0], [199.0, 283.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.7990502119064331, "coordinate": [544, 293, 780, 315], "order": 2, "polygon_points": [[544.0, 293.0], [780.0, 293.0], [780.0, 315.0], [544.0, 315.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9265228509902954, "coordinate": [198, 375, 975, 470], "order": 3, "polygon_points": [[198.0, 375.0], [975.0, 375.0], [975.0, 470.0], [198.0, 470.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9487090706825256, "coordinate": [199, 479, 601, 647], "order": 4, "polygon_points": [[199.0, 479.0], [601.0, 479.0], [601.0, 647.0], [199.0, 647.0]]}, {"cls_id": 14, "label": "image", "score": 0.9767951965332031, "coordinate": [614, 482, 966, 715], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[614.0, 482.0], [966.0, 482.0], [966.0, 715.0], [614.0, 715.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8278966546058655, "coordinate": [239, 689, 478, 715], "order": 5, "polygon_points": [[239.0, 689.0], [478.0, 689.0], [478.0, 715.0], [239.0, 715.0]]}, {"cls_id": 24, "label": "vision_footnote", "score": 0.8105261325836182, "coordinate": [808, 720, 968, 740], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[808.0, 719.9999389648438], [967.0, 719.9999389648438], [967.0, 738.9999389648438], [808.0, 738.9999389648438]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.7998085618019104, "coordinate": [238, 724, 605, 750], "order": 6, "polygon_points": [[238.0, 724.0], [605.0, 724.0], [605.0, 750.0], [238.0, 750.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.928371012210846, "coordinate": [197, 759, 976, 891], "order": 7, "polygon_points": [[197.0, 759.0], [976.0, 759.0], [976.0, 891.0], [197.0, 891.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.585299551486969, "coordinate": [382, 899, 831, 924], "order": 8, "polygon_points": [[382.0, 899.0], [831.0, 899.0], [831.0, 924.0], [382.0, 924.0]]}, {"cls_id": 14, "label": "image", "score": 0.9384303092956543, "coordinate": [172, 905, 525, 1224], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[172.0, 905.0], [525.0, 905.0], [525.0, 1224.0], [172.0, 1224.0]]}, {"cls_id": 24, "label": "vision_footnote", "score": 0.5060856938362122, "coordinate": [200, 1231, 326, 1252], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[200.0, 1231.0], [325.0, 1231.0], [325.0, 1251.0], [200.0, 1251.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9545217156410217, "coordinate": [514, 934, 978, 1240], "order": 9, "polygon_points": [[514.0, 934.0], [978.0, 934.0], [978.0, 1240.0], [514.0, 1240.0]]}, {"cls_id": 14, "label": "image", "score": 0.7430130839347839, "coordinate": [1002, 609, 1137, 724], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[1002.0, 609.0], [1137.0, 609.0], [1137.0, 724.0], [1002.0, 724.0]]}]}}, "markdown": {"text": "# 胖东来如何打造快乐团队\n\n信息来源：中国营销咨询网/周亮\n\n他是8000多名员工的“大家长”，走进企业就像走进一个快乐的大家庭。他提倡“财聚人散，财散人聚”，他所领导的企业普通员工拿着全省零售业最高的工资。他用自己半生的坎坷遭遇，总结出的200字的企业文化里，“快乐”字样出现四次。他没有太多文化，却把“以人为本”这一最朴素的管理哲学演绎得淋漓尽致。他说自己是一个“行商”，一年待在办公室里的时间总共不到5天，所有权力下放，用人不疑，充分发挥员工个人才智。\n\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_614_482_966_715.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"29%\" /></div>\n\n\n## 8000 人的大家庭其乐融融\n\n生鲜分割师比赛现场\n\n走在许昌的大街小巷，无论是大型综合\n\n商场、超市、服装市场，还是家电卖场、手机卖场及便利店，看到最多的是“胖东来”字样。而走进任何一家“胖东来”店，都挤满了正在购物的消费者。据了解，11年前“胖东来”还是一个只有4名下岗职工的30多平方米的小烟酒店。十几年来坚持“用真品换真心，不满意就退货”的承诺，赢得了广大消费者的信任，如今已发展成为拥有8000多名职工、\n\n22个连锁店、年销售额5亿多元的大型综合零售企业。\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_172_905_525_1224.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"29%\" /></div>\n\n\n员工子弟联谊会\n\n做零售业是很辛苦的，而在许昌胖东来，8000多人的大家庭却其乐融融，很多人脸上都挂着微笑，大家以兄弟姐妹相称。你能深切地体会到这里的员工没有烦闷情绪，只有盎然的笑脸和开怀的笑声。可以感受得到，他们是在发自内心地热爱着工作。记者采访时，外面正在下雨，一位保洁员不停地拖着地板。当问她工作累不累时，这位40多岁的大姐笑着说：“累是累，心里高兴！拿着比其他单位的保洁员高三四倍的工资，东来一口一个大姐地叫\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_1002_609_1137_724.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"11%\" /></div>\n", "images": {"imgs/img_in_header_image_box_839_135_1083_253.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//075bf837-940a-4888-90da-2e3557364fc9/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_header_image_box_839_135_1083_253.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T11%3A04%3A58Z%2F-1%2F%2F4b31bc03636e1eb43903fbc54fb23818ad9d58769f39df7ef59dd12076925256", "imgs/img_in_image_box_614_482_966_715.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//075bf837-940a-4888-90da-2e3557364fc9/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_image_box_614_482_966_715.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T11%3A04%3A58Z%2F-1%2F%2F4fe91f5f49474fc9f7e24eba8c7823ffafc8ed5425f6fd1535c0e41fc5cb172f", "imgs/img_in_image_box_172_905_525_1224.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//075bf837-940a-4888-90da-2e3557364fc9/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_image_box_172_905_525_1224.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T11%3A04%3A58Z%2F-1%2F%2Fdb32f4e37144550089b9308e3b0241672